KARBALA MEIN CHEHLUM HAI FATIMA KE DILBAR KA<br>
<br>
Karbala mein aaya hai chhutke qaid se kunba<br>
Bhai teri turbat par karne aaye hain girya<br>
Laaye phool ke badle aansuwo&rsquo;n ka ye tohfa<br>
Qabr par shah-e-deen ke nauha hai ye Zainab ka<br>
<br>
Phir raha hai aankho mein karbala ka wo manzar<br>
Bhai teri gardan par chal raha tha jab khanjar<br>
Saamne mere bhaiya kat raha tha tera sar<br>
Haye kaisi ghurbat thi dekhti rahi khwahar<br>
<br>
Baad tere aye bhai aafato&rsquo;n ne ghera tha<br>
Karbala ke jungle mein har taraf andhera tha<br>
Shaam ke biyabaa&rsquo;n mein khauf ka basera tha<br>
Paasbaa&rsquo;n koi na tha sab ne muh ko phera tha<br>
<br>
Baad-e-asre ashoora har qadam qayamat thi<br>
Karbala se koofa tak hum pe kya museebat thi<br>
Darbadar aseero par kaisi ye aziyath thi<br>
Bekasi ka aalam tha zulm ki bhi shiddath thi<br>
<br>
Zaalimo&rsquo;n ne Abed par is tarah sitam dhaaye<br>
Bediyaa&rsquo;n bhi pehnaayi tauq bhi wo pehnaye<br>
Paa barehna kaanto&rsquo;n par naatawa&rsquo;n ko chalwaye<br>
Pusht par lage durre zaqm bhi ubhar aaye<br>
<br>
Mehfil-e-Sitamgar mein le gaye hamein aada<br>
Sab aseer kunbe ke haath the rasan basta<br>
Reesma mein tha baandha ek gala Sakina ka<br>
Ab kaleja phat-ta hai kya batau aye bhaiya<br>
<br>
Karta hai Ali matam Fatima ke dilbar ka<br>
Aur karti hai matam Anjuman ye Sarwar ka<br>
Karne aaye hain Moula Arbayee&rsquo;n bahattar ka<br>
Ho qubool ye nauha Waasta Payambar ka
